* ============================================================================
* 15_table6_effect_size.do — Effect size + 95% CI reporting (MVP)
* Paper: {{PAPER_ID}}
*
* Rationale: MVP power is limited (n≈116, MDE≈0.27-0.30 SD). To avoid
* over-claiming on significance alone, this table reports:
*   (a) raw β with 95% CI
*   (b) standardized β (1 SD X → β SD Y)
*   (c) effect size relative to literature benchmarks (Jha-Liu-Manela 2026,
*       Hassan 2019 QJE, Tetlock 2007 JF)
* ============================================================================

version 19
clear all
set more off

if "$data_dir" == ""    global data_dir "../data"
if "$tables_dir" == ""  global tables_dir "../output/tables"

use "$data_dir/_prepared_panel.dta", clear

* Cross-sectional + bank-type FE specification (MVP)
reghdfe {{MAIN_DV}}_w {{ATTITUDE_VAR}} $controls, ///
    absorb(bank_type year) vce(cluster bank_id)
eststo MVP1

* Standardized coefficient
egen std_dv  = std({{MAIN_DV}}_w)
egen std_att = std({{ATTITUDE_VAR}})
reghdfe std_dv std_att $controls, ///
    absorb(bank_type year) vce(cluster bank_id)
eststo MVP2

* 1-year change design (Δbenefit → ΔY)
sort bank_id year
bysort bank_id: gen d_dv  = {{MAIN_DV}}_w - L1.{{MAIN_DV}}_w
bysort bank_id: gen d_att = {{ATTITUDE_VAR}} - L1.{{ATTITUDE_VAR}}
reg d_dv d_att $controls, vce(cluster bank_id)
eststo MVP3

* fix(omni-g-templates-misc, 2026-06-11): esttab 的 se 与 ci 互斥 (同抢系数下方
* 括号行, esttab 实报 "se may not be combined with ci" r(198) → 整表零产出)。
* 拆两表: 主表报 SE (与全包其余表同规格), 伴生 _ci 表报 95% CI (本表立意所在)。
esttab MVP1 MVP2 MVP3 using "$tables_dir/table6_effect_size.tex", replace ///
    star(* 0.10 ** 0.05 *** 0.01) se booktabs label compress b(3) ///
    title("Effect Size --- MVP Power-Conscious Report (SE)") ///
    mtitles("Raw" "Standardized" "1-yr Change") ///
    addnotes("MVP n=116. Standardized: 1 SD X --> beta SD Y. 95\% CI in companion table." ///
             "Reference: Jha 2026 RFS 0.15-0.25 SD; Hassan 2019 QJE 0.10-0.20 SD.")

esttab MVP1 MVP2 MVP3 using "$tables_dir/table6_effect_size_ci.tex", replace ///
    star(* 0.10 ** 0.05 *** 0.01) ci(3) booktabs label compress b(3) ///
    title("Effect Size with 95\% CI --- MVP Power-Conscious Report") ///
    mtitles("Raw" "Standardized" "1-yr Change") ///
    addnotes("MVP n=116. 95\% CI shown beneath coefficients (companion to SE table)." ///
             "Reference: Jha 2026 RFS 0.15-0.25 SD; Hassan 2019 QJE 0.10-0.20 SD.")

display "[OK] Table 6 effect size --> $tables_dir/table6_effect_size.tex (+ _ci companion)"
